<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Your account has been deleted
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Farewell for now
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Your Dukka account for <strong>{{email}}</strong> has been deleted as requested. Access to this account is no longer available, and associated personal data will be handled according to our retention policy.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Account" value=email}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Deleted"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Want to come back?"}}
  You are always welcome to create a new Dukka account anytime. If you deleted by mistake or need help recovering access, reach out to support as soon as possible.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thank you for being part of Dukka. We hope to see you again.
</p>
